  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 9th level, you exert fine control over the potent elemental energy of your weapon. When you deal damage with your Gadget Weapon, you gain a 1d8 bonus to that damage roll.</p>\n<p>In addition, when you activate an evocation creation that affects other creatures that you can see, you can choose a number of them equal to 1 + the creation's level. The chosen creatures automatically succeed on their saving throws against the creation, and they take no damage if they would normally take half damage on a successful save.</p>",
